# Thin Tauri Compose Shell

{{ product_name }} is a desktop launcher, a window, and a Compose manager.

Debug builds call Docker. A Windows release installer bundles the Podman engine and a Compose provider, and the shell runs the selected stack through `podman compose`.

See [reusable-compose-shell.md](reusable-compose-shell.md) for the full reuse contract.

