## Layout

- [src-tauri/](../src-tauri/) — Tauri 2 crate
- [shell.toml](../shell.toml) — stack manifest read by Rust
- [docker-compose.yml](../docker-compose.yml) — stack at the repo root
- [.env.example](../.env.example) — committed defaults; `.env` gitignored

No `services/` folder and no sidecar. The shell runs on the host beside the OS WebView. Development uses Docker or Podman, whichever `make init` recorded. The Windows installer bundles Podman.

